Consider the following program written in pseudo-code. Assume that $x$ and $y$ are integers:

```
Count(x, y) {
    if (y != 1) {
        if (x != 1) {
            print("*");
            Count(x/2, y);
        } else {
            y = y - 1;
            Count(1024, y);
        }
    }
}
```

The number of times that the print statement is executed by the call `Count(1024, 1024)` is ______.
